  "releaseNotes": "2.0.3 In Mutation Repository Update methods excluding Key field.\n2.0.2 Repository methods bool paramter bug fix.\n2.0.1 Added separate path for Stored Procedures and DB Context.\n2.0.0 Added Mutations Create, UpdateById, Update, DeleteById and Delete along with MutationInputTypes, CreateEntityInputType and UpdateEntityInputType. CreateInputType will have required fields as Non-Nullable while UpdateInputType will have all fields nullable.\nAdded Mutation fields for Stored Procedures.\nAlso, removed type: typeof(DateTimeGraphType) as its no longer needed and in GraphQL 9.x type will be removed from FieldBuilder.",
